    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME :</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are trapped in a strange version of your apartment, everything feels like a dream but it's too real to be just a dream.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >August Night is a short first-person perspective horror game where you try to find your way back to to <i>reality</i> by exploring the distorted logic of a place you once thought was just a regular old apartment building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game was previously available in a different form, this newer version is\u00a0<strong>remade, extended, and reimagined</strong> from the ground up. </p></li></ul>",
